for the function add post

id: Date.now(): Generates a quick, unique ID using the current millisecond timestamp.

author: me: Assigns the current user identifier to the post.

programme: user.dept || 'Student': Pulls the user's department from their profile (user.dept). If none is found, it safely falls back to 'Student'.

text: text: Stores what the user typed in the textarea.

img: img: Stores the image data returned by your readImage function.

likes: [], retweets: [], comments: []: Initializes empty arrays so users can like, retweet, or comment on the post later.

